{
  "title": "Quick Crunchy German English Muffin Casserole",
  "description": "A fatty and crunchy German dish featuring English muffins, perfect for a light meal, and is Jain-friendly as it does not contain any animal products or by-products. It is made with a braise for added flavor.",
  "cuisine": "German",
